  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d1eb87bd1c28cd449acda7359981c29c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Announcement
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ChunkDialogue
  lines:
  - text: So yes, we're being raided by Anarchon members...
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: Ah frick...
    correctID: 13
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3adff50d5f5b2574cbc96e1e08be9492, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: What even is this timeline bro....
    correctID: 14
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3adff50d5f5b2574cbc96e1e08be9492, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: Nah gng we're cooked if that's true...
    correctID: 15
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3adff50d5f5b2574cbc96e1e08be9492, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "Look, I and the others understand your concerns\u2026"
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "So, our plan as of currently is to... fight back\u2026 "
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: Somehow
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "The three people who go by \u201CHydrine\u201D, \u201CAeri\u201D, and
      \u201CAcyd\u201D aren\u2019t here right now but should show up soon\u2026"
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: Wait, what about them specifically?
    correctID: 16
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3adff50d5f5b2574cbc96e1e08be9492, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "They\u2019re the ones who gave us the info about the raid. "
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "And since they\u2019re Protagon members, they probably know a very good
      deal of what's gonna happen."
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "Better than us, I\u2019d even admit\u2026"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: " So they\u2019re our key out of this?"
    correctID: 17
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3adff50d5f5b2574cbc96e1e08be9492, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
  - text: "Eh, yeah\u2026"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
    typeDelay: 1
